.TH MARK-SHOT 1 "2026-11-13" "Mark Shot" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mark-shot \- native screenshot, annotation and recording tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mark-shot
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.RI [ IMAGE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Mark Shot provides native Wayland and X11 capture, image annotation,
scrolling screenshots, pinned images, local OCR, translation, barcode
recognition and screen recording without a Qt runtime.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Display all supported command-line options.
.TP
.B --version
Display the application version.
.TP
.B --background
Run the configured tray and global shortcuts.
.TP
.B --scroll
Select and stitch a scrolling screenshot.
.TP
.B --record
Open the native screen recording controller.
.TP
.B --settings
Open preferences.
.TP
.B --scan-json IMAGE
Decode an image locally and print barcode results without opening a window.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/mark-shot/config.toml
.SH NOTES
OCR models and its verified CPU runtime download only after an explicit user action.
The replaceable media library and corresponding sources are included in complete packages.
